<title>SPAIN: Spain's 3rd qtr unemployment falls to 21.91 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's 3rd qtr unemployment falls to 21.91 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Institute (INE) gave the following monthly figures:</p>
<p> UNEMPLOYMENT			Q3 '96	Q2 '96	Q3 '95</p>
<p> Total unemployed (mln)	  3.51	   3.54	  3.56</p>
<p> Pct of workforce (pct)	  21.91	  22.26	 22.73</p>
<p>NOTE - Data based on INE survey of households (EPA). The labour ministry publishes separate unemployment figures based on registered unemployed. Prior figures may be revised.</p>
</text>
